{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And the artistic band of its ephod.</b> The sash that is on the arm — with it he girds and fits it to the kohen and adorns it." "<b>Which is on it.</b> Above, at the edge of the sash — that is the girdle." "<b>Like its work.</b> Just as the weaving of the sash is artistic work and of five kinds [of thread], so the weaving of the חֵשֶׁב is artistic work and of five kinds." "<b>From it it shall be.</b> With it it shall be woven — they shall not weave it separately and then join it."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:55:05.968322219Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}